{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GbGMxivUPi1793025817.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一隻黑熊從俄羅斯渡河進入中國，當局提醒民眾注意安全。</p><p></p><p>黑龍江邊防民警，近日發現一隻長約1.5米、重約100公斤的年幼黑熊，從俄羅斯游水渡河，進入中國境內的青黃魚通島，估計牠是跟隨其他熊季節性遷徙。</p><p></p><p>當局向沿江民眾發布安全提醒，切勿靠近青黃魚通島以及周邊水域，禁止登島和驚擾野生動物，如果發現黑熊活動蹤跡，要立即通知派出所。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:10.571468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T18:18:07.619316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:21.263933+00:00","content_hash":"9049e0dbdfa7a4aae916e7f6b9a90507d2a989850617224f6b66231fbe848f00","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:10.571468+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}